    "q-108203": {
      "dom_id": "step-q108203",
      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "$\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{5})=$",
      "worked_solution": "First, let's recall the power rule for logarithms:\n\n$$\n{log}_{n}⁡({c}^{m})=m{log}_{n}⁡(c)\n$$\n\nUsing the power rule for logarithms, we get:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{5})=5\\operatorname{ln}⁡x\\end{aligned}\n$$",
